; Amazing Grace (the tune "New Britain", 1829 - public domain), arranged
; for this port, about 29 seconds.  It shows the pitch effects: vibrato
; on the melody, a portamento up to its high note, and a pad that glides
; from chord to chord.
; Play it with: mml /usr/share/examples/gba/grace.mml

ABC t100

; A: the melody, with a vibrato that starts an eighth into each note
A o4 l4 @wd2 v11 @v5,3,8
A d  g2 b8 g8  b2 a  g2 e  d2 d  g2 b8 g8  b2 a
A @p40 >d2.^2 @p0 <b  >d2 <b8 g8  b2 a  g2 e  d2 d  g2 b8 g8  b2 a  g2.^2.

; B: a soft pad, gliding between the chords
B o4 l2. @wd1 v5 @p6 @v3,1,4
B r4 d d e d  d d f+ d  d d e d  d f+ d^2.

; C: the bass on the wave channel
C o3 l2. v2
C r4 g g >c< g  g g d g  g g >c< g  g d g^2.
